---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout title="Websites for Artists">
  <h1>Websites for Artists</h1>

  <p>
    Custom websites built specifically for artists and their work.
  </p>

  <p>
    I can build you a site that presents your work clearly, loads quickly,
    and gives you a simple way to keep it up to date. It could be similar
    in look to mine, or designed differently around your work, with the
    added shopping cart functions.
  </p>

  <h2>What the Site Can Include</h2>

  <div class="writing-item">
    <ul>
      <li>Custom design built around your artwork</li>
      <li>Artwork portfolio and galleries</li>
      <li>Blog or studio journal</li>
      <li>Pages for biography, writings, exhibitions, and contact</li>
      <li>Stripe shopping cart for selling artwork</li>
      <li>Shipping and tax handling</li>
      <li>Fast-loading, mobile-friendly pages</li>
      <li>Search engine optimization</li>
      <li>Privacy-friendly Cloudflare analytics</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <h2>Easy to Keep Updated</h2>

  <p>
    The site can include a simple desktop Site Manager for adding artwork,
    writing posts, uploading images, and publishing updates.
  </p>

  <p>
    You wouldn't need to know web development or work with a complicated
    content-management system.
  </p>

  <h2>Custom, Not Pre-Made</h2>

  <p>
    A site can be designed around the artist and the work rather than
    forcing everything into a pre-made template.
  </p>

  <p>
    It could be similar in look to mine, or something completely different
    depending on what fits your work.
  </p>

  <h2>Pricing</h2>

  <div class="writing-item">
    <h3>Custom Artist Website — $2,500</h3>

    <ul>
      <li>Custom design and development</li>
      <li>Artwork portfolio</li>
      <li>Blog or other custom sections</li>
      <li>Optional Stripe shopping cart</li>
      <li>Mobile optimization</li>
      <li>SEO setup</li>
      <li>Image optimization</li>
      <li>Cloudflare hosting and analytics</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      Hosting and routine maintenance are available for $30/month.
    </p>

    <p>
      Additional features or larger changes can be quoted separately.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>PageSpeed Results</h2>

  <p>
    I designed this site to run very light and fast.
    <a
      href="https://pagespeed.web.dev/analysis/https-stephenbreighner-com/u1gzhne22z?form_factor=mobile"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      View PageSpeed results
    </a>
  </p>

  

  <h2>Interested?</h2>

  <p>
    If you're an artist looking for a website built around your work,
    get in touch and tell me a little about what you're looking for.
  </p>

  <p>
    <a href="/contact">Contact me</a>
  </p>
</PageLayout>